    ["<Assistant_Title1>【旌旗的赞颂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得旌旗的赞颂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Praise of the Banner] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Praise of the Banner; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
