    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您所在的家族中%s对%s发起的弹劾流程已结束，当前家族首席已回归并拒绝了您的弹劾流程。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>The impeachment process initiated by %s against %s in your family has ended. The current Family Chief has returned and rejected your impeachment process.</>",
