    ["I plan to let {{他|她}} go for a walk in Tingen again to learn more about this place."] = "I plan to let {{him|her}} go for a walk in Tingen again to learn more about this place.",
    ["[MailMask_Gift_Panel]: 礼品邮件不可能进收藏, MailId = %s"] = "[MailMask_Gift_Panel]: Gift mail cannot be added to favorites, MailId = %s",
