    ["拉斐尔作为子爵夫人的弟弟，死于数年前家族覆灭的夜晚。\n他生前是个强壮的孩子，以拳头和力气为傲，是姐姐忠诚的跟班和守护者。\n他在伟大母亲的注视下复生后，变得更加强悍勇猛，代价是失去了人的智力，记不清任何生前的事——除了一件事：他要守护一个人。\n是谁呢……在哪里……要保护的人……不能忘记……\n“好好留在这儿，完成对子嗣的守护吧。”不知过去了多少年，有个声音同他说。\n拉斐尔靠在巨大的茧下，感受到一种特殊的悸动，仿佛是来自血脉的呼唤，让他从浑噩中苏醒。他本能地张嘴，去呼唤一个深埋在记忆中的词语：姐姐……姐姐……\n我终于找到你了……姐姐……\n绯色指环的亮光一闪而过。\n他从未遗忘过幼年的承诺。\n就算变成了可怖的样子，他也必会用尽全力，守护珍视的一切。"] = "Raphael, as the younger brother of the Viscountess, died on the night of the family's destruction years ago. \n He was a strong child in his lifetime, proud of his fists and strength, and was his sister's loyal follower and Guardian. \n After he was reborn under the gaze of the Great Mother, he became even more powerful and fierce, at the cost of losing human intelligence and forgetting everything from his past life—except for one thing: he had to guard someone. \n Who was it... where... the person to protect... must not forget... \n \"Stay here well and complete the guardianship of the offspring.\" After many years had passed, a voice said to him. \n Raphael leaned against the giant cocoon, feeling a special throb, as if it were a call from his bloodline, waking him from his stupor. He instinctively opened his mouth to call out a word buried deep in his memory: Sister... Sister... \n I finally found you... Sister... \n The light of the crimson ring flashed by. \n He had never forgotten the promise of his childhood. \n Even if he had become a terrifying sight, he would surely use all his strength to guard everything he cherished.",
